---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Applications — Crawler Under-Ceiling Platform Use Cases"
  description="ARC lifts and platforms for stadium ceiling construction, airport terminal maintenance, and warehouse steel structure ceiling work."
  transparentNav={false}
>

  <!-- HERO BANNER -->
  <section class="hero-banner" style="--banner-image:url('/images/banners/applications.webp');--banner-position:center 58%;">
    <div class="overline">Solutions</div>
    <h1>BUILT FOR THESE CEILINGS</h1>
    <p>Specialized aerial access solutions for tall indoor spaces. From stadiums to airports to warehouses.</p>
  </section>

  <!-- STADIUM -->
  <section class="sec">
    <div class="scenario reveal">
      <div class="scenario__visual">
        <img src="/images/home/wall-panel-platform.webp" alt="Large work platform positioned inside a steel structure" width="1200" height="800" loading="lazy" />
      </div>
      <div class="scenario__text">
        <div class="scenario__tag">Stadium & Arena</div>
        <h3>Stadium Ceiling Solutions</h3>
        <p>Large-span steel structures can require acoustic-panel, lighting, service and maintenance access. A large-deck crawler concept may reduce temporary works after bearing, route, clearance and rescue planning are verified.</p>
        <div class="scenario__features">
          <span class="scenario__feature"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg>Height Verification</span>
          <span class="scenario__feature"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg>Load Planning</span>
          <span class="scenario__feature"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg>Floor Protection</span>
          <span class="scenario__feature"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg>Remote Control</span>
        </div>
        <div class="scenario__btns">
          <a href="/applications/stadium/" class="btn btn--primary">View Details →</a>
          <a href="/contact/" class="btn btn--outline-blue">Get a Quote</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- AIRPORT -->
  <section class="sec sec--gray">
    <div class="scenario scenario--reverse reveal">
      <div class="scenario__visual">
        <img src="/images/home/under-ceiling-field-v2.webp" alt="ARCLIFT-branded under-ceiling crawler platform operating in a large indoor structure" width="1200" height="800" loading="lazy" />
      </div>
      <div class="scenario__text">
        <div class="scenario__tag">Airport Terminal</div>
        <h3>Airport Ceiling Maintenance</h3>
        <p>Terminal work can involve ceiling panels, lighting, HVAC and emergency access. Indoor use requires confirmation of the exact electric power mode, sound level, floor load, security route and occupied-space controls.</p>
        <div class="scenario__features">
          <span class="scenario__feature"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg>Electric Option Review</span>
          <span class="scenario__feature"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg>Occupied-Space Plan</span>
          <span class="scenario__feature"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg>Floor Load Check</span>
          <span class="scenario__feature"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg>Compact Access</span>
        </div>
        <div class="scenario__btns">
          <a href="/applications/airport/" class="btn btn--primary">View Details →</a>
          <a href="/contact/" class="btn btn--outline-blue">Get a Quote</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- WAREHOUSE -->
  <section class="sec">
    <div class="scenario reveal">
      <div class="scenario__visual">
        <img src="/images/home/roof-panel-output.webp" alt="Long roof panels being produced close to roof level" width="1200" height="800" loading="lazy" />
      </div>
      <div class="scenario__text">
        <div class="scenario__tag">Warehouse & Factory</div>
        <h3>Industrial Ceiling Construction</h3>
        <p>Warehouses and factories combine roof-panel production, high-bay ceiling work and overhead maintenance. The right solution may be a roll-forming lift, a large-deck platform or a conventional access method after site review.</p>
        <div class="scenario__features">
          <span class="scenario__feature"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg>Workflow Comparison</span>
          <span class="scenario__feature"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg>Deck by Project</span>
          <span class="scenario__feature"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg>Travel Mode Review</span>
          <span class="scenario__feature"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg>All-Terrain Tracks</span>
        </div>
        <div class="scenario__btns">
          <a href="/applications/warehouse/" class="btn btn--primary">View Details →</a>
          <a href="/contact/" class="btn btn--outline-blue">Get a Quote</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- STATS -->
  <section class="sec sec--dark">
    <div class="stats reveal">
      <div class="stat"><div class="stat__num">01</div><div class="stat__label">Confirm Working Height</div></div>
      <div class="stat"><div class="stat__num">02</div><div class="stat__label">Check Bearing Conditions</div></div>
      <div class="stat"><div class="stat__num">03</div><div class="stat__label">Plan Access & Rescue</div></div>
      <div class="stat"><div class="stat__num">04</div><div class="stat__label">Approve Final Configuration</div></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="cta">
    <h2>NOT SURE WHICH SOLUTION FITS YOUR PROJECT?</h2>
    <p>Tell us about your ceiling project and our engineering team will recommend the right model.</p>
    <a href="/contact/" class="btn--white">Get a Free Consultation →</a>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
